<title>UK: Austria launches 2.0 billion ATS medium term bills.</title>
<headline>Austria launches 2.0 billion ATS medium term bills.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria has launched a 2.0 billion Austrian Schilling tranche of four-year medium term bills, lead manager GiroCredit said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal due February 14, 2001, pays a coupon of 4.20 percent and has an issue price of 100.05.</p>
<p>The deal will be subject to Austrian law and listed on the Vienna stock exchange, with denominations of 100,000 Austrian Schillings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7970</p>
